        "text": "${{\\left( \\overrightarrow{a}.\\overrightarrow{b} \\right)}^{2}}={{\\left( \\overrightarrow{a} \\right)}^{2}}.{{\\left( \\overrightarrow{b} \\right)}^{2}}$"
